{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1399914-distance-realm","id":1399914,"title":"\"Distance\" Realm","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-29T14:52:39-07:00","id":1399914,"title":"\"Distance\" Realm","content":"Has anyone toyed with the idea of adding a Realm covering extended range for Cantrip targets? Something like using Arcane Connections like in Ars Magica or the Correspondence Sphere of Mage, to affect targets outside immediate perception.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T15:07:56-07:00","id":1399918,"title":"","content":"While it's possible, I personally think that adding any Realms risks disturbing the balance of the art mechanics and that the Setting Realm may be better suited to what you want to do with a few tweaks or additions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T15:17:04-07:00","id":1399921,"title":"","content":"Remember, you never <i>need</i> a Realm: if you don't have sufficient dots in it, you just pay Glamour to make up the difference. So adding a Connection-like Realm would grant everyone the ability to do the Voodoo Doll thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T16:27:40-07:00","id":1399936,"title":"","content":"Thinking about these considerations, I kinda agree! How would you add to the Scene Realm to allow far targeting?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T18:22:16-07:00","id":1399962,"title":"","content":"The Countless Dreams book rejiggers the realms as Theories and the Space theory covers distance and volume.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T21:42:54-07:00","id":1400001,"title":"","content":"O personally use true names as a way to cast a art on someone no matter where the people is.<br /> <br /> I think special bunks are more fitting for this too. Like making a entire festival, ritual or using a very specific event, like a eclipse, or the first kiss of true love as a really powerful bunk that can target someone of something across very far distances.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> This way it requires a lot more of roleplaying. Simply having some dots on a realm and then casting a long distance cantrip is kinda too gamey. Remember, Even the common realms have roleplaying in it. For low level you need to know the person name, etc.<br /> <br /> <br /> I could see some sense if it was a &quot;places&quot; realm. and with similar considerations. On low dots you had to have lived in the place before, with more dots, you at least needed to have visited the place once, etc. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-30T10:23:16-07:00","id":1400130,"title":"","content":"I agree, thanks a lot for these feedbacks! Rucun, your suggestion about True Names makes a lot of sense!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"r